# bootloader.manifest — system config owned by mod_grub (GRUB theme + silence hook).
# Managed system paths (root to reset), restored from the W source. The selection
# 9-patch PNGs are w-style output (900-grub) recoloured from the SYSTEM theme —
# class `rendered`, kept over their `w`-coloured seeds. theme.txt is patched in
# place by the same axis but is also the layout template, so it stays managed (an
# update reverts its colours until the next `w-style apply all|grub`). The encrypted
# Limine path (package-limine.md) ships its own bits and is not covered here.
# Format: <path>\t<class>   (trailing '/' = directory)
/boot/grub/themes/w/	managed
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/c.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/e.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/n.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/ne.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/nw.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/s.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/se.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/sw.png	rendered
/boot/grub/themes/w/select/w.png	rendered
/etc/pacman.d/hooks/grub-silence.hook	managed
